==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In general, it is a good idea to stall the initial peons with an anti-red tank such as [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] to build up to max wallet.

It is recommended to have all unstarred anti-alien treasures from Into the Future.

Then attempt to set-up a quick kill on Nimoy Bore by stacking anti-alien CC units, such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] before moving into the enemy base. Then attempt to severely damage it before the next spawn. The goal is to get the [[Nimoy Bore]] and [[Bore]] to stack up with each other and deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly kill them almost simultaneously. This must be done before the [[Dread Bore]] finishes its burrowing attack to get behind the frontline.

If done correctly enough attackers will survive to immediately destroy the enemy base without even having to kill [[Dread Bore]], who is not a huge threat on its own.

Otherwise a reset may be needed if there is insufficient DPS, as all 3 bores will stack together which is still manageable with good meatshielding and LD attackers.

